# Block32 preflight witnesses

For the symbolic table

\[
 Q_\lambda=(1-\lambda)J_4/16+\lambda I_4/4,
\]

the sixteen weights sum to one and each one-tip marginal is `1/4`.
Every cell is strictly positive on `0 <= lambda < 1`; the equality event has
probability `(1+3 lambda)/4`.  The pair tensor is

\[
 E[g^i h^j]=\lambda(\delta^{ij}-f^if^j)/2,
\]

whereas every observable `A(g)+B(h)` is independent of `lambda`.

After the frozen Block31 word `U`, every exact reached configuration has one
of sixteen tokens and all comparator transients are clean.  The full pointer
configuration is still needed in `P_r` because `U` produces reversible junk
on malformed inputs.  The sixteen token sectors and 3,136 complete pointer
configurations are orthogonal.

For one route, Block30 supplies ten distinct Blank trail targets inside a
common 160-block carrier.  The reached second-use pair has eight clear lateral
targets and writes two of them.  Hence a complete fired transaction consumes
twelve Blank blocks, leaving 146 of the initial 158 Blank carrier blocks.  A
one-hot persistent selector supplies an independent no-refire debit.

The target runner must recompute every statement above, plus symbolic
transition-row normalization and the prefix marginal.  These are preflight
witnesses, not execution results.
